# Normalise line endings in the repository.
#
# Without this, Windows checkouts rewrite every LF file to CRLF in the working
# tree, and `git status` reports the whole project as modified after any clone on
# a different OS. Text files are stored as LF in the repo and converted on
# checkout; real binaries are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary

*.ps1  text eol=crlf
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
